{"seq":1,"slug":"tdr-vna-principles","title":"TDR/VNA 测量原理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/hardware-electronics/signal-integrity/measurement-techniques/tdr-vna-principles","wordCount":2085,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"tdr-vna-测量原理\">TDR/VNA 测量原理</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>互连表征的本质是&quot;用两个互补视角还原同一个网络&quot;，四个关键概念：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>时域 vs 频域</strong>：TDR 时域直接给出阻抗剖面（直觉性强），VNA 频域给出 S 参数（动态范围大）；二者可经 FFT/IFFT 相互转换。</li>\n<li><strong>空间分辨率</strong>：TDR 的分辨率由系统上升时间决定（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>p</mi></msub><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>r</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v_p t_r/2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/2</span></span></span></span></span>，约 1–3 mm），VNA 的分辨率由频率范围决定。</li>\n<li><strong>校准与去嵌入</strong>：VNA 依赖 SOLT/TRL/ECal 把参考面移到 DUT 端口；夹具、探针影响必须通过去嵌入（TRL、2x-Thru、AFR）移除。</li>\n<li><strong>测量设置权衡</strong>：频率范围、点数、IF 带宽、平均次数与功率电平共同决定精度与速度的平衡。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"互连表征的测量需求\">互连表征的测量需求</h2><p>高速数字互连的设计验证需要准确的电气特性表征。两种核心测量工具——时域反射计（TDR）和矢量网络分析仪（VNA）——从不同角度提供互连信息：TDR 在时域直接揭示阻抗随空间位置的分布，VNA 在频域精确描述网络的传输和反射特性。</p>\n<p>两种工具的互补关系：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特性</th>\n<th>TDR</th>\n<th>VNA</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>工作域</td>\n<td>时域</td>\n<td>频域</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>核心输出</td>\n<td>阻抗剖面</td>\n<td>S 参数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>空间分辨率</td>\n<td>由系统上升时间决定</td>\n<td>由频率范围决定</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>动态范围</td>\n<td>40–60 dB</td>\n<td>80–120 dB</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>校准复杂度</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>高（需要精密校准件）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>直觉性</td>\n<td>高（直接看阻抗）</td>\n<td>中（需要频域分析经验）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>价格</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[互连表征] --&gt; B[TDR 时域测量]&#10;    A --&gt; C[VNA 频域测量]&#10;    B --&gt; B1[阻抗剖面]&#10;    B --&gt; B2[时延/距离定位]&#10;    B --&gt; B3[差分/共模阻抗]&#10;    C --&gt; C1[S参数矩阵]&#10;    C --&gt; C2[插入损耗/回波损耗]&#10;    C --&gt; C3[混合模式分析]&#10;    B --&gt; D[FFT变换]&#10;    C --&gt; E[IFFT变换]&#10;    D --&gt; C1&#10;    E --&gt; B1\">graph TD\n    A[互连表征] --&gt; B[TDR 时域测量]\n    A --&gt; C[VNA 频域测量]\n    B --&gt; B1[阻抗剖面]\n    B --&gt; B2[时延/距离定位]\n    B --&gt; B3[差分/共模阻抗]\n    C --&gt; C1[S参数矩阵]\n    C --&gt; C2[插入损耗/回波损耗]\n    C --&gt; C3[混合模式分析]\n    B --&gt; D[FFT变换]\n    C --&gt; E[IFFT变换]\n    D --&gt; C1\n    E --&gt; B1</pre><h2 id=\"tdr-工作原理\">TDR 工作原理</h2><h3 id=\"基本原理\">基本原理</h3><p>TDR 向被测传输线注入一个快速上升沿的阶跃脉冲，然后记录反射回来的信号随时间的变化。由于信号以已知速度传播，反射到达的时间可以转换为空间位置，反射幅度则对应该位置的阻抗值。</p>\n<p>阻抗计算公式：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>ρ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>ρ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Z(t) = Z_0 \\cdot \\frac{1 + \\rho(t)}{1 - \\rho(t)}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">Z</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">Z</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.363em;vertical-align:-0.936em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ρ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rho(t)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 为反射系数的时域波形，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Z</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Z_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">Z</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为系统参考阻抗（通常 50 Ω）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"tdr-系统关键参数\">TDR 系统关键参数</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>参数</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>典型值</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>系统上升时间</td>\n<td>注入脉冲的上升时间</td>\n<td>15–35 ps</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>空间分辨率</td>\n<td>可分辨的最小特征尺寸</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>p</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>r</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v_p \\cdot t_r / 2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7306em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/2</span></span></span></span></span> ≈ 1–3 mm</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>时间窗口</td>\n<td>最大可观测时间/距离</td>\n<td>数百 ns / 数十米</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>阻抗精度</td>\n<td>阻抗测量准确度</td>\n<td>±1–2%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>采样率</td>\n<td>等效采样率</td>\n<td>&gt; 100 GS/s</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"tdr-波形解读\">TDR 波形解读</h3><p>典型 TDR 响应的物理解释：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>波形特征</th>\n<th>阻抗变化</th>\n<th>物理原因</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>向上台阶</td>\n<td>阻抗增大</td>\n<td>走线变窄、介质减薄</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>向下台阶</td>\n<td>阻抗减小</td>\n<td>走线变宽、过孔电容</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>正向尖峰</td>\n<td>感性不连续</td>\n<td>过孔电感、引线</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>负向凹陷</td>\n<td>容性不连续</td>\n<td>焊盘电容、连接器</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>振荡</td>\n<td>LC 谐振</td>\n<td>过孔残桩谐振</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"差分-tdr\">差分 TDR</h3><p>差分 TDR 同时在差分对的两条线上注入信号，测量差分阻抗和共模阻抗：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>差分激励（odd mode）：两线信号相反极性 → 测量差分阻抗 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>f</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>o</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Z_{diff} = 2 \\cdot Z_{odd}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">Z</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">Z</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">dd</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></li>\n<li>共模激励（even mode）：两线信号同极性 → 测量共模阻抗 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>m</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>e</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Z_{comm} = Z_{even}/2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">Z</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">co</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">mm</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">Z</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/2</span></span></span></span></span></li>\n<li>模式转换：差分激励下的共模响应 → 评估对称性</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"vna-工作原理\">VNA 工作原理</h2><h3 id=\"基本架构\">基本架构</h3><p>VNA 通过扫频正弦信号激励被测网络，测量每个频率点的反射和透射响应。关键组成部分：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>信号源</strong>：产生精确频率和幅度的扫频信号</li>\n<li><strong>方向耦合器</strong>：分离入射波和反射波</li>\n<li><strong>接收器</strong>：测量信号的幅度和相位</li>\n<li><strong>参考通道</strong>：提供相位参考</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"vna-校准\">VNA 校准</h3><p>精确的 VNA 测量依赖于高质量的校准。校准的目的是消除系统误差（电缆、适配器、夹具的影响），将测量参考面移至被测器件的端口。</p>\n<p>主要校准方法：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>校准件</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n<th>精度</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>SOLT</td>\n<td>Short-Open-Load-Thru</td>\n<td>同轴连接</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>TRL</td>\n<td>Thru-Reflect-Line</td>\n<td>非同轴/PCB 在板</td>\n<td>最高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SOLR</td>\n<td>Short-Open-Load-Reciprocal</td>\n<td>非插入式</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ECal</td>\n<td>电子校准件</td>\n<td>快速校准</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"trl-校准详解\">TRL 校准详解</h3><p>TRL 校准特别适用于 PCB 互连的在板测量：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Thru</strong>：直接连接两个测试端口（或已知长度的传输线）</li>\n<li><strong>Reflect</strong>：在参考面放置高反射标准（开路或短路）</li>\n<li><strong>Line</strong>：已知电长度的传输线段</li>\n</ul>\n<p>TRL 的优势在于不需要精确已知校准件的阻抗，仅依赖传输线的特性，适合 PCB 环境中难以实现精密负载的情况。</p>\n<h2 id=\"去嵌入技术\">去嵌入技术</h2><h3 id=\"去嵌入的必要性\">去嵌入的必要性</h3><p>实际测量中，被测器件（DUT）总是通过夹具、探针或连接器接入测量系统。这些非 DUT 部分的影响必须被移除（去嵌入），才能获得纯 DUT 的特性。</p>\n<h3 id=\"常用去嵌入方法\">常用去嵌入方法</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>原理</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>TRL 校准</td>\n<td>在板校准件</td>\n<td>PCB 嵌入式测量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2x-Thru 去嵌入</td>\n<td>IEEE 370-2020 标准</td>\n<td>对称夹具</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>端口扩展</td>\n<td>已知电长度补偿</td>\n<td>简单均匀传输线</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>时域门控</td>\n<td>TDR 时窗选择</td>\n<td>快速粗略去嵌入</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>AFR（自动夹具移除）</td>\n<td>基于传输线理论</td>\n<td>已知夹具结构</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"ieee-370-2020-标准\">IEEE 370-2020 标准</h3><p>IEEE 370-2020 定义了统一的高速互连表征方法，核心内容包括：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>2x-Thru 去嵌入：使用双倍长度的 Thru 结构提取夹具 S 参数</li>\n<li>1x-Reflect 去嵌入：结合 Thru 和 Reflect 测量</li>\n<li>质量度量：定义了去嵌入结果的验证准则</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"tdr-与-vna-的相互转换\">TDR 与 VNA 的相互转换</h2><h3 id=\"tdr-s-参数\">TDR → S 参数</h3><p>通过对 TDR/TDT 时域波形进行 FFT，可以提取 S 参数：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>采集 TDR 反射波形和 TDT 透射波形</li>\n<li>对参考信号和 DUT 响应分别做 FFT</li>\n<li>计算 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>11</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>F</mi><mi>F</mi><mi>T</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>反射</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>F</mi><mi>F</mi><mi>T</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>入射</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S_{11}(f) = FFT(反射)/FFT(入射)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">11</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">反射</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">入射</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></li>\n<li>计算 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>21</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>F</mi><mi>F</mi><mi>T</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>透射</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>F</mi><mi>F</mi><mi>T</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>入射</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S_{21}(f) = FFT(透射)/FFT(入射)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">21</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">透射</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">入射</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"vna-时域\">VNA → 时域</h3><p>对 VNA 测量的 S 参数做 IFFT 可以获得时域响应：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>11</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mover><mo stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"3.0em\">→</mo><mpadded width=\"+0.6em\" lspace=\"0.3em\"><mrow><mi>I</mi><mi>F</mi><mi>F</mi><mi>T</mi></mrow></mpadded></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S_{11}(f) \\xrightarrow{IFFT}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.3503em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">11</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel x-arrow\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1003em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.322em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight x-arrow-pad\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-2.689em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"height:0.522em;min-width:1.469em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.522em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 522\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMaxYMin slice\"><path d=\"M0 241v40h399891c-47.3 35.3-84 78-110 128\n-16.7 32-27.7 63.7-33 95 0 1.3-.2 2.7-.5 4-.3 1.3-.5 2.3-.5 3 0 7.3 6.7 11 20\n 11 8 0 13.2-.8 15.5-2.5 2.3-1.7 4.2-5.5 5.5-11.5 2-13.3 5.7-27 11-41 14.7-44.7\n 39-84.5 73-119.5s73.7-60.2 119-75.5c6-2 9-5.7 9-11s-3-9-9-11c-45.3-15.3-85\n-40.5-119-75.5s-58.3-74.8-73-119.5c-4.7-14-8.3-27.3-11-40-1.3-6.7-3.2-10.8-5.5\n-12.5-2.3-1.7-7.5-2.5-15.5-2.5-14 0-21 3.7-21 11 0 2 2 10.3 6 25 20.7 83.3 67\n 151.7 139 205zm0 0v40h399900v-40z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.011em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> TDR 阻抗剖面</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>21</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mover><mo stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"3.0em\">→</mo><mpadded width=\"+0.6em\" lspace=\"0.3em\"><mrow><mi>I</mi><mi>F</mi><mi>F</mi><mi>T</mi></mrow></mpadded></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S_{21}(f) \\xrightarrow{IFFT}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.3503em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">21</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel x-arrow\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1003em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.322em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight x-arrow-pad\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-2.689em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"height:0.522em;min-width:1.469em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.522em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 522\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMaxYMin slice\"><path d=\"M0 241v40h399891c-47.3 35.3-84 78-110 128\n-16.7 32-27.7 63.7-33 95 0 1.3-.2 2.7-.5 4-.3 1.3-.5 2.3-.5 3 0 7.3 6.7 11 20\n 11 8 0 13.2-.8 15.5-2.5 2.3-1.7 4.2-5.5 5.5-11.5 2-13.3 5.7-27 11-41 14.7-44.7\n 39-84.5 73-119.5s73.7-60.2 119-75.5c6-2 9-5.7 9-11s-3-9-9-11c-45.3-15.3-85\n-40.5-119-75.5s-58.3-74.8-73-119.5c-4.7-14-8.3-27.3-11-40-1.3-6.7-3.2-10.8-5.5\n-12.5-2.3-1.7-7.5-2.5-15.5-2.5-14 0-21 3.7-21 11 0 2 2 10.3 6 25 20.7 83.3 67\n 151.7 139 205zm0 0v40h399900v-40z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.011em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 脉冲响应或阶跃响应</li>\n</ul>\n<p>时域变换的注意事项：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>需要处理 DC 外推（VNA 不测 DC 点）</li>\n<li>窗函数选择影响时域分辨率和旁瓣</li>\n<li>频率步进决定时域窗口长度</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"测量实践指南\">测量实践指南</h2><h3 id=\"探测方式选择\">探测方式选择</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>探测方式</th>\n<th>带宽</th>\n<th>适用</th>\n<th>侵入性</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>SMA 连接器</td>\n<td>DC–26 GHz</td>\n<td>PCB 测试点</td>\n<td>永久焊接</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>GSSG 探针</td>\n<td>DC–40 GHz</td>\n<td>差分对在板测量</td>\n<td>接触式</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>同轴电缆</td>\n<td>DC–50 GHz</td>\n<td>连接器间测量</td>\n<td>非侵入</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>微探针</td>\n<td>DC–67 GHz</td>\n<td>晶圆/封装级</td>\n<td>接触式</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"测量设置最佳实践\">测量设置最佳实践</h3><ol>\n<li><strong>频率范围</strong>：覆盖 DC 到至少 3 倍奈奎斯特频率</li>\n<li><strong>频率点数</strong>：足够密集以捕获谐振（至少 1601 点）</li>\n<li><strong>IF 带宽</strong>：在精度和速度间平衡（通常 1–10 kHz）</li>\n<li><strong>平均次数</strong>：增加平均提高动态范围（每增加一倍约 3 dB）</li>\n<li><strong>功率电平</strong>：避免过高功率引起非线性，过低功率降低 SNR</li>\n</ol>\n<p>TDR 和 VNA 是信号完整性工程师的核心测量工具。掌握两者的原理和使用方法，能够准确表征互连结构的电气特性，为设计验证和调试提供可靠数据支撑。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>本文从测量需求出发，对比并打通了 TDR 与 VNA 两条技术路线：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>二者互补：TDR 在时域给出阻抗剖面、时延定位与差分/共模阻抗，VNA 在频域给出 S 参数矩阵、插损/回损与混合模式分析，动态范围与直觉性各有取舍。</li>\n<li>TDR 以快速阶跃脉冲测量反射，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>ρ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>ρ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Z(t) = Z_0(1+\\rho)/(1-\\rho)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">Z</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">Z</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 把反射系数转为阻抗，分辨率由上升时间决定，波形台阶/尖峰/凹陷分别对应不同不连续类型。</li>\n<li>VNA 通过扫频测量反射与透射，精度依赖校准（SOLT/TRL/SOLR/ECal），TRL 因不依赖精密负载而特别适合 PCB 在板测量。</li>\n<li>去嵌入（TRL、2x-Thru、端口扩展、时域门控、AFR）移除夹具与探针影响，IEEE 370-2020 提供了统一方法。</li>\n<li>时域与频域可经 FFT/IFFT 互转，需注意 DC 外推、窗函数与频率步进的影响。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>两条路径结合，能完整刻画互连结构的电气特性，支撑设计验证与调试。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"TDR/VNA 测量原理","id":"tdr-vna-测量原理"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"互连表征的测量需求","id":"互连表征的测量需求"},{"level":2,"text":"TDR 工作原理","id":"tdr-工作原理"},{"level":3,"text":"基本原理","id":"基本原理"},{"level":3,"text":"TDR 系统关键参数","id":"tdr-系统关键参数"},{"level":3,"text":"TDR 波形解读","id":"tdr-波形解读"},{"level":3,"text":"差分 TDR","id":"差分-tdr"},{"level":2,"text":"VNA 工作原理","id":"vna-工作原理"},{"level":3,"text":"基本架构","id":"基本架构"},{"level":3,"text":"VNA 校准","id":"vna-校准"},{"level":3,"text":"TRL 校准详解","id":"trl-校准详解"},{"level":2,"text":"去嵌入技术","id":"去嵌入技术"},{"level":3,"text":"去嵌入的必要性","id":"去嵌入的必要性"},{"level":3,"text":"常用去嵌入方法","id":"常用去嵌入方法"},{"level":3,"text":"IEEE 370-2020 标准","id":"ieee-370-2020-标准"},{"level":2,"text":"TDR 与 VNA 的相互转换","id":"tdr-与-vna-的相互转换"},{"level":3,"text":"TDR → S 参数","id":"tdr-s-参数"},{"level":3,"text":"VNA → 时域","id":"vna-时域"},{"level":2,"text":"测量实践指南","id":"测量实践指南"},{"level":3,"text":"探测方式选择","id":"探测方式选择"},{"level":3,"text":"测量设置最佳实践","id":"测量设置最佳实践"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"眼图分析与均衡","url":"/l-doc-books/h/hardware-electronics/signal-integrity/high-speed-design/eye-diagram-equalization"},"next":{"title":"S 参数与网络分析","url":"/l-doc-books/h/hardware-electronics/signal-integrity/measurement-techniques/s-parameters-analysis"}}